WEBVTT

00:12:30.292 --> 00:12:32.224
And if we do that,

00:12:32.248 --> 00:12:34.535
here's how we can start
to think about the world.

00:12:34.559 --> 00:12:36.938
We can look at orcas and say,

00:12:36.962 --> 00:12:39.668
we know they grieve,
we know they feel their lives,

00:12:39.692 --> 00:12:45.109
and we can refuse to confine them
to small tanks in theme parks

00:12:45.133 --> 00:12:48.312
and make them perform
for our entertainment.

00:12:48.336 --> 00:12:50.495
(Applause)

00:12:50.519 --> 00:12:52.809
Thank you.

00:12:52.833 --> 00:12:55.884
We can look at elephants
and say, yes, they grieve,

00:12:55.908 --> 00:12:59.652
and we can renew our efforts
against international trophy hunting

00:12:59.676 --> 00:13:01.215
and against poaching.